* ELM2021 Vize Ornegi 2: DC Pilli Seri Kirpici (Series Clipper with Bias)
* Boylestad Ornek: Vm=20V sinus, Vdc=+5V destekleyici pil, ideal diyot (Vk=0)
* Beklenen El Hesabi: Vi > -5V iken Vo = Vi + 5 (max +25V), Vi <= -5V iken Vo = 0V

.model D_IDEAL D(IS=1e-15 N=0.001)

Vin in 0 SIN(0 20 1k)
D1 in d_out D_IDEAL
Vdc vo d_out DC 5
Rload vo 0 10k

.control
  tran 10u 2m
  plot v(in) v(vo) title 'Seri Kirpici Zaman Domeni'
  dc Vin -20 20 0.2
  plot v(vo) title 'Transfer Karakteristigi Vo vs Vin'
.endc

.end

